# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

hello is project
hello purpose "Print a greeting; a stage0 sample that refined run and the built executable both run"
hello target console
hello version "0.1.0"
hello language refined 1
hello standardLibrary 1
hello allows write console.stdout none
hello requires none
hello includesModule hello
hello entry hello.main
